{"id":3754,"path":"/grammar-points/a1/a-an-plurals/","parentId":540,"order":30,"section":"grammar-points","level":"a1","depth":3,"title":"A/an, plurals: Singular and plural forms","seo":{"title":"A/an, plurals: Singular and plural forms - Test-English","description":"Learn how to use 'a', 'an' and plurals in this A1 Elementary grammar lesson. Clear rules, charts and exercises. Practise now!","image":"/media/uploads/A1Grammar_a-an_plurals.png"},"modified":"2026-02-18T09:15:59","kind":"lesson","parts":["<h3>Exercise 1</h3> <h5>Choose a/an for the following words.</h5> <div data-quiz=\"424\"></div>","<h3>Exercise 2</h3> <h5>Write the plurals of the following singular words.</h5> <p><em>EXAMPLE: A nice sofa ⇒ nice <span class=\"textGap\">sofas</span></em><br> </p><div data-quiz=\"425\"></div> <p></p>","<h3>Exercise 3</h3> <h5>Write <em>a/an</em> before the singular words and write the plural forms.</h5> <p><em>EXAMPLE: <span class=\"textGap\">An</span> olive ⇒ <span class=\"textGap\">olives</span></em><br> </p><div data-quiz=\"426\"></div> <p></p>"],"explanation":"<h2><strong>A/an</strong>, plurals – Grammar chart</h2> <p><img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-10815\" src=\"/media/uploads/a-an_plurals.png\" alt=\"Comprehensive English grammar chart displaying rules for using articles 'a/an' and forming regular and irregular plurals with examples and spelling guidelines.\" width=\"500\" height=\"500\" loading=\"lazy\"></p> <h6></h6> <h2>A/an</h2> <p>We use&nbsp;<strong>a/an</strong> with singular nouns.</p> <ul class=\"grammar-ex\"> <li><em>This is <span><strong>a table</strong></span>.&nbsp;</em></li> <li><em>It’s <span><strong>an orange</strong></span>.&nbsp;</em></li> </ul> <p>We use <strong>a</strong> with nouns beginning with a consonant, and we use&nbsp;<strong>an</strong> with nouns beginning with a vowel (a, e, i, o, u).</p> <ul class=\"grammar-ex\"> <li><em>Give me <span><strong>an a</strong></span>pple.&nbsp;</em></li> <li><em>There is <span><strong>an e</strong></span>lephant in the zoo.&nbsp;</em></li> <li><em>It’s <span><strong>an a</strong></span>mazing experience.&nbsp;</em></li> </ul> <p>We also use&nbsp;<strong>an</strong> with nouns beginning with&nbsp;<strong>h</strong> if the&nbsp;<strong>h&nbsp;</strong>is not pronounced. But we use&nbsp;<strong>a</strong> if the&nbsp;<strong>h&nbsp;</strong>is pronounced.</p> <ul class=\"grammar-ex\"> <li><em>Give me <span><strong>an h</strong></span>our.</em> (The&nbsp;<strong>h&nbsp;</strong>is not pronounced in&nbsp;<strong><del>h</del>our</strong>.)</li> <li><em>I want to buy <span><strong>a h</strong></span>at</em>. (The&nbsp;<strong>h&nbsp;</strong>is pronounced in&nbsp;<strong>hat</strong>.)</li> </ul> <p>We use&nbsp;<strong>a</strong> and NOT&nbsp;<strong>an</strong> with nouns beginning with&nbsp;<strong>u&nbsp;</strong>when it is pronounced /ju:/, like&nbsp;<strong>university.&nbsp;</strong></p> <ul class=\"grammar-ex\"> <li><em>Is there <span><strong>a u</strong></span>niversity in this city?&nbsp;</em></li> <li><em>I wear <span><strong>a u</strong></span>niform.&nbsp;</em></li> </ul> <h2>Plurals in English</h2> <h4>Do not use <em><strong>a</strong>&nbsp;</em>+ plural</h4> <p>We do NOT use&nbsp;<strong>a/an</strong> with plural nouns.</p> <ul class=\"grammar-ex\"> <li><em>These are <span><strong>tables</strong></span></em><span>. <img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-21425\" src=\"https://test-english.pro/staging101/wp-content/uploads/correct.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></li> <li><em>These are <span><strong>a tables</strong></span></em><span>. <img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-21426\" src=\"https://test-english.pro/staging101/wp-content/uploads/wrong.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></li> </ul> <h4>Regular plurals</h4> <p>We add&nbsp;<strong>-s </strong>to make plural nouns in English. Sometimes we need to add&nbsp;<strong>-es</strong>, <strong>-ies</strong>&nbsp;or –<strong>ves</strong>. Check the spelling in the grammar chart above.</p> <h4>Irregular plurals</h4> <p>Some words have irregular plurals and do NOT add&nbsp;<strong>-s&nbsp;</strong>to make their plural form.</p>","quizzes":[{"id":424,"questions":[{"id":3666,"num":"1","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>It's <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> animal. </p>","gaps":[{"kind":"select","options":["an","a"]}]},{"id":3667,"num":"2","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>I need <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> new bed.</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"select","options":["a","an"]}]},{"id":3668,"num":"3","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>It's <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> useful machine.</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"select","options":["an","a"]}]},{"id":3669,"num":"4","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>I'm <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> waiter. </p>","gaps":[{"kind":"select","options":["a","an"]}]},{"id":3670,"num":"5","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>Do you have <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> umbrella?</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"select","options":["a","an"]}]},{"id":3671,"num":"6","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>I'm <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> English teacher. </p>","gaps":[{"kind":"select","options":["an","a"]}]},{"id":3672,"num":"7","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>I need <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> hat. </p>","gaps":[{"kind":"select","options":["a","an"]}]},{"id":3673,"num":"8","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>Is she <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> student?</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"select","options":["a","an"]}]},{"id":3674,"num":"9","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>We have <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> ugly duck. </p>","gaps":[{"kind":"select","options":["a","an"]}]},{"id":3675,"num":"10","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>I need <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> hour. </p>","gaps":[{"kind":"select","options":["a","an"]}]}]},{"id":425,"questions":[{"id":3676,"num":"1","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>a university ⇒ <span data-gap=\"0\"></span></p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":3677,"num":"2","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>a sandwich ⇒ <span data-gap=\"0\"></span></p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":3678,"num":"3","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>a street ⇒ <span data-gap=\"0\"></span></p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":3679,"num":"4","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>a rich man ⇒ rich <span data-gap=\"0\"></span></p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":3680,"num":"5","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>one foot ⇒ two <span data-gap=\"0\"></span></p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":3681,"num":"6","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>a dirty bag ⇒ dirty <span data-gap=\"0\"></span></p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":3682,"num":"7","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>an expensive watch ⇒ expensive <span data-gap=\"0\"></span></p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":3683,"num":"8","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>a new phone ⇒ new <span data-gap=\"0\"></span></p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":3684,"num":"9","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>a nice photograph ⇒ nice <span data-gap=\"0\"></span></p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":3685,"num":"10","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>One glass of wine ⇒ two <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> of wine</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"}]}]},{"id":426,"questions":[{"id":3686,"num":"1","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p><span data-gap=\"0\"></span> bus ⇒ <span data-gap=\"1\"></span></p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"},{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":3687,"num":"2","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p><span data-gap=\"0\"></span> nice family ⇒ nice <span data-gap=\"1\"></span></p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"},{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":3688,"num":"3","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p><span data-gap=\"0\"></span> Italian child ⇒ Italian <span data-gap=\"1\"></span></p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"},{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":3689,"num":"4","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p><span data-gap=\"0\"></span> strong tooth ⇒ strong <span data-gap=\"1\"></span></p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"},{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":3690,"num":"5","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p><span data-gap=\"0\"></span> nice dress ⇒ nice <span data-gap=\"1\"></span></p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"},{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":3691,"num":"6","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p><span data-gap=\"0\"></span> angry wife ⇒ angry <span data-gap=\"1\"></span></p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"},{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":3692,"num":"7","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p><span data-gap=\"0\"></span> uniform ⇒ <span data-gap=\"1\"></span></p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"},{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":3693,"num":"8","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p><span data-gap=\"0\"></span> amazing website ⇒ amazing <span data-gap=\"1\"></span></p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"},{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":3694,"num":"9","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p><span data-gap=\"0\"></span> elephant ⇒ <span data-gap=\"1\"></span></p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"},{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":3695,"num":"10","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p><span data-gap=\"0\"></span> empty library ⇒ empty <span data-gap=\"1\"></span></p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"},{"kind":"text"}]}]}]}